OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure would be
OL,4,Adevastating, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have expressed opposition over
OL,7,Fplans to close a primary school that
OL,8,Finspectors recently praised for
OL,9,Fnurturing pupils.
OL,11,FRichmond Council is proposing to close
OL,12,FKew Riverside Primary School, in Kew,
OL,13,Fafter a drop in student numbers left
OL,14,Fthe 210-capacity school with just 87
OL,15,Fpupils. The school faces a budget
OL,16,Fdeficit of #400,000 by 2028.
OL,18,FThe council says the proposals are only
OL,19,Fat the consultation stage and that no
OL,20,Ffinal decision has been made, but
OL,21,Fparents gathered outside the school on
OL,22,FTuesday to voice their opposition:
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
