OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure would be
OL,4,Adevastating, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is a devastating impact for us,"
OL,7,Fsaid Iona Ferguson, who has a Year Five
OL,8,Fchild with special educational needs
OL,9,Fand disabilities (SEND) at the
OL,10,Fsouth-west London school.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
